    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a massive Ice Crawler powered by a nuclear power plant on a distant planet where you need to generate energy to survive and rescue other survivors. Your crawler base can accommodate dozens of survivors and have dozens of floors. Learn how to build a nuclear power plant to survive in this frozen world, and explore a map full of mysteries and resources where the future of humanity depends on the crawler rescuing and finding the resources to do so.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721760/extras/a814c0abcafa4b2f68cd54fe595cf635.avif?t=1755129363\" width=616 height=159 /></span>Build and simulate a realistic nuclear power plant, with boilers, reactors, steam, turbines and control the Rods to generate energy to heat and move your Crawler. Accidents can happen.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721760/extras/da0b95c5fa215294702230ddddd011c7.avif?t=1755129363\" width=616 height=117 /></span><br>Explore a giant planet and rescue survivors and collect resources to build your base. Use the remains left by space mining companies and keep your crew alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721760/extras/a4d1b868307462bb260bb202aebe5e79.avif?t=1755129363\" width=616 height=229 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will have to maneuver obstacles and maneuver to collect resources. Avoid mines, rocks, cliffs and some drones that can be hostile. Upgrade your Crawler, unlock technologies and find items on the map. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game will be released in 2026.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a massive Ice Crawler powered by a nuclear power plant on a distant planet where you need to generate energy to survive and rescue other survivors. Your crawler base can accommodate dozens of survivors and have dozens of floors. Learn how to build a nuclear power plant to survive in this frozen world, and explore a map full of mysteries and resources where the future of humanity depends on the crawler rescuing and finding the resources to do so.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721760/extras/a814c0abcafa4b2f68cd54fe595cf635.avif?t=1755129363\" width=616 height=159 /></span>Build and simulate a realistic nuclear power plant, with boilers, reactors, steam, turbines and control the Rods to generate energy to heat and move your Crawler. Accidents can happen.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721760/extras/da0b95c5fa215294702230ddddd011c7.avif?t=1755129363\" width=616 height=117 /></span><br>Explore a giant planet and rescue survivors and collect resources to build your base. Use the remains left by space mining companies and keep your crew alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2721760/extras/a4d1b868307462bb260bb202aebe5e79.avif?t=1755129363\" width=616 height=229 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will have to maneuver obstacles and maneuver to collect resources. Avoid mines, rocks, cliffs and some drones that can be hostile. Upgrade your Crawler, unlock technologies and find items on the map. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game will be released in 2026.</p>",
